{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05168","headline":"奉荅燕公 · 王琚","name":"奉荅燕公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡远途且艰，宜悲良自得。\n胡爲心独尔，惠好在南国。\n亦既清颜披，冏然良愿克。\n与君兰时会，羣物如藻饰。\n烟景惜欢赏，云山起翰墨。\n接艺奇思微，偶谈玄言直。\n永日不知倦，逾旬犹谓亟。\n如何酌离尊，移櫂巴城侧。\n浦口劳长望，舟中独太息。\n疾风吹飞帆，倏忽南与北。\n目尽不复见，怀哉无终极。\n唯当衡峰上，遥辨湖水色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王琚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}